Subject: [PATCH] Unit tests for enabledTools.service and staff

enabledTools: the enabled keys, every row, a parameterised toggle and an
unknown key. staff: empty lists, staff plus curator ids, and a review
number matched across formats (fictional numbers). Tests only.

